
📄 ROS 2 WAVE ROVER – Implementation Specification (for Claude Code)
1. System Context

Implement a ROS 2 (Jazzy, Ubuntu 24.04) based robotics system for a differential-drive mobile robot.

Hardware configuration (fixed)
Raspberry Pi 4 / 5 (main compute)
Motor Driver HAT (controlled directly from RPi via GPIO/I2C/PWM)
4 DC motors (NO encoders)
IMU (connected to RPi)
LiDAR LD19
Camera Module 3 (CSI)
2. High-Level Goals

The system must support:

✅ REQUIRED
Manual control (teleoperation)
IMU-based yaw stabilization (straight driving correction)
SLAM (visualized in RViz)
Autonomous navigation (Nav2)
